:: OC Kazu Library Practice [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="Color: Yellow">As you walk past one of the bookcases in the library, you hear something… strange. Someone is in the next aisle over speaking, though you can’t understand a word they are saying.</span> It takes you a minute to realize they are speaking another language, but not one you’ve ever heard before. You are a bit unsure how to describe it. It has some tonal and pitch changes and has strong, popping vowel sounds at the end of some words. <br>
<br>
You peek past one of the books and see the speaker, which you weren’t expecting. It’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>! He is standing in the corner reading quietly from a book. He seems to struggle with some words, changing the pitches of certain sounds until it is right. <span style="Color: Yellow">Curious, you walk to the aisle he is in and ask him what he is doing.</span> <br>
<br>

    <<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "OC Kazu",
		State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
			Mouth: "Frown",
            Eyes: "Mad",
            Blush: 1,
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Frown",
		    },
	    },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> jumps at your sudden appearance, tossing the book away. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What!? Nothing! What are you doing? Spying!? You creep!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">He glares at you with flushed cheeks, obviously caught off-guard and a little embarrassed.</span> You ask him what language he was speaking. It sounded pretty good, though isn’t Japanese, at least you don’t think so. <span style="Color: Pink">This just causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> to turn even more red.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I wasn’t speaking anything! I was looking through an anatomy book for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang’s</span> dumb science test. All the dicks in science books are stupid and tiny, probably like yours! I bet yours is the smallest of all!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> teasingly tackles you and tries to pull your bottoms down to get a look at your <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“tiny thing”</span> until a shooshing teacher causes him to release you and walk off muttering under his breath. <br>
<br>
Whatever he was doing, he seemed a little embarrassed about it.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Kazu" 3 1>>
